  "notes": "Supplying logprobs, logit_bias or top_logprobs returns 400; n must be 1. Streams end with data: [DONE]. Responses is documented as beta. Audio transcription, translation and speech are documented under the same base. Transcription and translation use OpenAI's audio wire: https://console.groq.com/docs/speech-to-text Files and batches evidence records the fields and endpoints used by the M9.2 adapter: Files use multipart file and purpose=batch; batch creation uses completion_window, endpoint, input_file_id and optional metadata. The documented endpoint is limited to /v1/chat/completions; file objects report bytes, created_at, filename, id, object and purpose. Batch output/error file ids and Unix timestamps are OpenAI-shaped.",
